    "title": "Subaru Unveils Japan-Only BRZ Type RA With Race-Inspired Upgrades - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Johnny Puckett ,\n8 hours ago Subaru has revealed a new limited-production variant of the BRZ exclusively for Japan, launching the Type RA as a highly focused, race-inspired addition to the lineup. The model follows closely behind the debut of the BRZ Yellow Edition, but this version leans heavily into motorsport hardware and tuning. Only 300 units will be built, making it one of the rarest BRZ versions to date. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
